WEBVTT

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:22.470
Hey kid, you got your allowance yesterday, right?

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:24.600
There's a game we want...

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:26.050
Um... Um...

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:27.290
Hey.

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:29.980
You're in my way.

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:32.400
Who's the broad?

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:34.900
W-Wait! Is she who I think she is?

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:45.180
You're Seiyo Elementary's ultimate "cool & spicy" student, Hinamori Amu-san!

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:47.830
Hinamori Amu?!

00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:51.360
I've heard rumors she singlehandedly defeated Sakura Elementary's entire soccer team!

00:00:51.410 --> 00:00:56.100
Apparently all the elementary schools in Kanto accepted her for free, and no principal dares defy her!

00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:59.060
W-We're sorry!

00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:04.530
Who starts these rumors, anyway?

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:08.500
Thank you so much! Could I please have your autograph?

00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:12.610
Are you stupid? You were in my way, too.

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:15.730
Be more careful.

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:22.300
She's so cool!

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:43.740
Hop, step, jump.

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:45.640
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:47.450
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:48.900
Who I wanna be. 

00:01:56.140 --> 00:02:00.150
They call me calm, strong, and cool. 

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:04.500
Everyone says I'm popular.

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:07.910
But the truth is, I'm not like that at all. 

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:11.120
I'm just an ordinary girl! 

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:15.230
I wish I could just get rid 

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:19.010
of all this pressure and be myself. 

00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:22.850
But they'd all say it's out of character. 

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:27.260
Unlock my heart! 

00:02:28.070 --> 00:02:32.610
Just be who you wanna be. 

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:35.460
Your Guardian Characters are with you. 

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:39.710
Just do it the way you wanna do it. 

00:02:39.710 --> 00:02:42.780
It'll be okay, really! 

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:47.690
Just be who you wanna be. 

00:02:47.690 --> 00:02:50.460
Having only one style would be way too boring. 

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:54.720
Just do it the way you wanna do it. 

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:58.990
You can do anything! 

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:00.610
I know that...

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:02.450
Hop, step, jump.

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:04.340
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:06.210
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:07.520
...is who I wanna be. 

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:13.040
Episode 1
A Guardian Character is Born!

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:16.930
Hey, did you hear how she stopped those bullies from taking money?

00:03:16.990 --> 00:03:21.670
Yeah, I did! Hinamori-san's so cool!

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:22.620
5th Grade: Star Class

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:24.440
It's like she's in a class by herself.

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:26.690
It feels like you even have to approach her with caution.

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:29.170
The way she wears her uniform is really cool, too.

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:31.470
Her mother's a journalist for a famous magazine...

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:34.200
...and her father's a gifted photographer!

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:36.500
Everything about her is super cool!

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:38.830
I bet her boyfriend's older than her and a celebrity!

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:39.720
Like an idol?

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:41.730
I bet he's from France!

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:43.990
They're gossiping again.

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:49.110
That's not what I'm like at all.

00:03:54.010 --> 00:03:57.080
There's a guardian spirit behind you!

00:03:57.180 --> 00:04:02.720
That's right. No matter who they are, every human has a guardian spirit protecting them!

00:04:02.790 --> 00:04:05.310
That's dumb, and so not true.

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:09.030
But the fortune-teller Saeki Nobuko is the real deal.

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:11.720
Even in my magazine, she's really popular with married women!

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:14.230
Never mind that, look at this! It's my new masterpiece!

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:16.520
Oh my! You've done it again!

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:19.900
A journalist for a famous magazine and a gifted photographer, huh?

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:24.080
I'm scared, Sis! I don't like ghosts!

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:26.100
That's a person, Ami.

00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:27.580
Ghost!

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:30.420
No, they are not ghosts.

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:33.500
Guardian spirits fight for you.

00:04:33.570 --> 00:04:39.200
They are always watching over the real you from the shadows.

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:41.130
As if, that's just stupid.

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:43.680
Those who call them stupid will die.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:47.910
It sounded like she was talking to me.

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:50.820
That's because I am.

00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:53.890
What's wrong, Amu-chan?

00:04:54.110 --> 00:04:58.600
It<i> is</i> stupid. Guardian spirits are something weak people cling to in desperate times.

00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:00.990
I'll never need them.

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:02.460
Thanks for the food.

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:06.690
She's so cool!

00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:19.780
That was awful.

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:21.230
What just happened?

00:05:21.270 --> 00:05:23.540
I'm so bad with occult stuff!

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:24.950
This is bad! This is so bad!

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:28.010
I can't even take a bath and wash my hair!

00:05:33.340 --> 00:05:36.430
My outer character exhausted me today.

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:40.580
My outer character, who I am around others...

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:43.760
It just takes over and then I go too far.

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:45.910
That's not me, though.

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:48.290
But I just can't be honest.

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:53.620
First day after transferring schools

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:53.880
Everyone, please welcome your new classmate, Hinamori Amu-san.

00:05:53.960 --> 00:05:56.730
Oh no! What should I do? What should I say?

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:58.300
Hinamori-san?

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:04.280
Well, nice to meet'cha.

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:12.640
My utter lack of skill at talking and the way I seem cynical somehow always comes off as me being "cool." 

00:06:12.200 --> 00:06:15.950
Fairytale Style                       Gothic Punk Style

00:06:12.730 --> 00:06:16.850
And my mom's taste in clothes just makes it worse.

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:22.570
I mean, even I'd like to wear something pink and frilly now and then.

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:25.760
I'd like to be cuter and more straightforward...

00:06:26.980 --> 00:06:30.920
But I guess it's too late for me to be like that.

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:37.110
They are always watching over the real you from the shadows.

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:42.140
Yeah right.

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:53.240
The real me...

00:06:57.400 --> 00:07:04.620
Guardian spirit, if you really, truly exist, then I'm sorry for making fun of you.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:12.400
Please give me the courage to be reborn as the person I truly want to be.

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:18.820
Right, so I made a wish, but...

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:24.310
Why are there eggs?

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:25.830
Did I give birth to them?

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:28.730
I said I wanted to be reborn, not<i> give birth! </i>

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:32.720
Ah! They didn't teach us this in Health class! 

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:38.800
They're warm.

00:07:42.740 --> 00:07:46.150
That means something really will be born from these.

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:52.640
Oh yeah!

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:56.730
So light, I'll fly away!

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:01.470
Wonderful, Ami-chan! You're my little star!

00:08:01.510 --> 00:08:03.290
Oh, good morning, Amu-chan!

00:08:04.140 --> 00:08:05.270
Morning.

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:09.270
Of all things...

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:11.810
Mom, you know...

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:15.140
Look, look! Here's today's best shot!

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:17.580
Wow, it's so cute!

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:19.690
What's wrong, Amu-chan?

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:21.330
Nothing.

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:35.980
I thought it'd be bad if I just left them in my room, so I brought them along, but...

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:39.680
Wow!

00:08:39.730 --> 00:08:41.630
They're as magnificent as ever.

00:08:41.740 --> 00:08:44.190
The Guardians of Seiyo Elementary.

00:08:53.650 --> 00:08:57.510
You might not've heard of them, since you're new here.

00:08:57.560 --> 00:09:02.200
The Guardians are somewhat of a unique student council, made by and operating on behalf of the students!

00:09:02.260 --> 00:09:07.230
They protect us from things like invasions of privacy; they even look after our concerns!

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:08.760
They are literally guardians!

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:11.250
The King's Chair: Hotori Tadase-sama.

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:13.880
The Queen's Chair: Fujisaki Nadeshiko-sama.

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:16.670
The Jack's Chair: Soma Kukai-sama.

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:19.560
The Ace's Chair: Yuiki Yaya-chama.

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:23.520
The Guardians even have a Royal Garden where they hold tea parties.

00:09:23.570 --> 00:09:27.170
And to top it off, they have a royal cape which only they can wear.

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:29.180
It's all so royal!

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:31.190
That cape's actually...

00:09:31.230 --> 00:09:32.370
Right? 

00:09:32.430 --> 00:09:36.240
Not really. Flocking around guardians or whatever is just childish.

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:40.060
That's our Hinamori-san, she's always "cool & spicy." 

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:41.860
She's so great!

00:09:41.920 --> 00:09:43.850
Tadase-sama!

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:44.680
You're so wonderful!

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:45.750
You have such beautiful hair!

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:47.560
He really is Seiyo's prince.

00:09:48.030 --> 00:09:49.060
Ah, the prince.

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:51.130
He's so ridiculously cute today.

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:51.960
But... 

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:58.770
I can't say it! An un-cute girl like me should never like the school's prince!

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:09.040
What's going on?

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:13.950
Hey, what's happening?

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:22.240
Um, you... Are you... 

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:34.630
Would you mind not touching me like that, shrimp? 

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:38.220
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:43.120
I did it again!

00:10:43.190 --> 00:10:44.650
You dummy! You always make things worse!

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:48.590
That was my first contact with my dreamy prince!

00:10:51.870 --> 00:10:53.580
Hotori-kun, that girl...

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:56.430
Yes. They're still just eggs, but she's a Character Bearer.

00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:59.440
I saw them, too. She had three Guardian Eggs!

00:11:00.140 --> 00:11:02.450
Looks like she'll be a strong one.

00:11:06.170 --> 00:11:08.310
So she's finally here.

00:11:08.920 --> 00:11:17.280
Yes. The holder of three eggs, the one who will inherit the legendary Humpty Lock, has finally arrived.

00:11:29.320 --> 00:11:33.160
What's that sound? The Humpty Lock?

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:05.790
We will now begin the Fall Guardians' Assembly.

00:12:05.860 --> 00:12:10.370
For our first order of business, I'd like to announce the results of the survey regarding school uniforms.

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:14.590
The closer I look at the prince, the more amazing he gets.

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:15.820
But...

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:20.350
Would you mind not touching me like that, shrimp?

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:22.620
I can't believe I said that.

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:25.340
I'm sure he hates me now.

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:28.900
All right, if anyone has anything to add, please raise your hand.

00:12:28.950 --> 00:12:34.350
"I'm sorry about what I said. The truth is, I like you." I want to be someone who could actually say that.

00:12:34.430 --> 00:12:36.140
Just do it, then!

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:40.650
Character Change: From a girl who can't express her feelings, to a girl who can!

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:45.600
I do! I'm sorry about what I said. The truth is, I like you, Prince!

00:12:53.970 --> 00:12:57.010
What was that? My mouth and body moved on their own.

00:12:58.200 --> 00:13:03.090
We're in the middle of an assembly, so please refrain from making unrelated comments.

00:13:03.490 --> 00:13:08.750
Also, I already like someone. I'm sorry.

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:11.140
No way.

00:13:20.810 --> 00:13:22.820
Okay, that's it.

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:26.270
If no one has any thoughts on this, we'll go to the next topic.

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:27.510
Soma-kun.

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:29.820
Leave the rest to us.

00:13:32.060 --> 00:13:33.100
Why did I...

00:13:33.150 --> 00:13:34.600
Why did I do that?

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:37.920
That isn't how I really am!

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:41.300
How could I say that in front of everyone?

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:43.640
I wish I could crawl inside a hole and never come out!

00:13:44.610 --> 00:13:47.370
Huh, a hole?!

00:13:50.370 --> 00:13:51.980
O-Ouch.

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:55.870
You're kidding.

00:13:56.990 --> 00:13:59.980
Is anyone there? Help!

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:01.740
Day off!

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:05.000
You've gotta be kidding, this can't be happening.

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:06.480
Amu-chan!

00:14:16.930 --> 00:14:18.030
What?

00:14:20.990 --> 00:14:22.910
I smell eggs.

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:40.140
What are you doing, Amu-chan?

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:41.680
Let's jump!

00:14:41.710 --> 00:14:43.260
J-Jump?

00:14:43.970 --> 00:14:47.830
Character Change: From a girl who can't jump, to a girl who can!

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:49.320
Hop!

00:14:49.390 --> 00:14:50.330
Step!

00:14:50.390 --> 00:14:52.390
Jump!

00:14:53.690 --> 00:14:54.760
W-What?

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:57.520
What are these things from ten years ago?

00:14:57.560 --> 00:14:59.530
This is so embarrassing!

00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:00.880
That's the first thing you scream?

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:04.070
What's going on?

00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:06.310
M-My body's moving on its own!

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:08.340
Stop!

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:20.480
Now we're in even more trouble.

00:15:20.610 --> 00:15:23.120
What just happened? What <i>are</i> you?

00:15:23.180 --> 00:15:26.620
I'm Ran, your Guardian Character.

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:28.280
Guardian Character?

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:29.030
That's right.

00:15:29.060 --> 00:15:31.480
I'm who you want to be.

00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:33.920
Who I want to be?

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:38.160
Isn't that what you wished for? To be someone else?

00:15:38.210 --> 00:15:41.010
I was born from those feelings.

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:44.110
T-That's impossible. I don't believe you.

00:15:44.190 --> 00:15:49.320
Believe me! Then you can be who you want-to-be!

00:15:57.210 --> 00:15:59.140
So you're a Character Bearer.

00:15:59.300 --> 00:16:00.740
Another weirdo?

00:16:00.800 --> 00:16:02.800
And this one has cat ears?

00:16:11.640 --> 00:16:12.740
What?

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:17.360
It seems you have more eggs.

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:19.440
Two of them.

00:16:19.610 --> 00:16:20.890
Who are you guys?

00:16:20.940 --> 00:16:23.550
Be careful, Amu-chan. These guys are after your-

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:27.600
So your name is Amu?

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:33.540
Don't touch me there, you jerk!

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:35.740
Found them.

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:38.200
Give them back, you egg thief!

00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:41.770
Looks like they're about to be born.

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:43.940
We have the Humpty Lock, too.

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:45.670
We got quite the haul today.

00:16:45.740 --> 00:16:47.480
Ikuto, let's go.

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:48.260
Yeah.

00:16:48.810 --> 00:16:49.820
Wait!

00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:54.950
My eggs are...

00:16:55.520 --> 00:16:56.840
My eggs...

00:16:58.060 --> 00:16:59.970
Who I want to be...

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:02.270
What...

00:17:02.510 --> 00:17:07.930
What are you doing to my eggs?

00:17:07.980 --> 00:17:08.990
Amu-chan!

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:16.140
The eggs!

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:22.980
Amu-chan!

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:24.680
She fell.

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:26.060
Amu-chan, let's jump again!

00:17:26.090 --> 00:17:27.380
Let's do another Character Change!

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:28.050
But...

00:17:28.090 --> 00:17:32.010
Believe! Believe in who you want to be!

00:17:32.170 --> 00:17:34.240
Who I want to be...

00:17:34.930 --> 00:17:37.510
Please give me the courage to be reborn as the person...

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:41.030
I truly want to be!

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:04.960
That's...

00:18:17.130 --> 00:18:18.590
It can't be...

00:18:18.920 --> 00:18:20.330
Character Transformation?

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:27.270
What's up with this outfit? This is embarrassing!

00:18:27.340 --> 00:18:29.900
I'm not like this at all!

00:18:31.640 --> 00:18:37.090
But this is strange, my body's light as a feather!

00:18:41.710 --> 00:18:44.790
She can do Character Transformations.

00:18:44.920 --> 00:18:47.910
Amazing. She's already progressed so far.

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:51.420
Great job, Amu-chan! You can do a Character Transformation already!

00:18:51.460 --> 00:18:52.370
Character Transformation?

00:18:52.390 --> 00:18:56.560
It's when you use 120% of your Guardian Character's power.

00:18:58.020 --> 00:18:59.380
Character Transformation?

00:19:02.680 --> 00:19:06.290
No way! I shouldn't be able to do this!

00:19:06.340 --> 00:19:10.270
A-Amu-chan, believe in yourself! If you don't...

00:19:11.140 --> 00:19:12.390
You'll turn back!

00:19:13.800 --> 00:19:15.070
Amu-chan!

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:19.540
Amu-chan!

00:19:41.190 --> 00:19:43.370
T-The prince...

00:19:46.690 --> 00:19:49.880
You again, little king?

00:19:49.940 --> 00:19:52.700
It's against the rules to go after eggs right after they're born!

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:56.300
Not to mention, you tried to get your hands on the Humpty Lock.

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:57.720
Tsukiyomi Ikuto!

00:19:57.780 --> 00:20:00.320
I think it's your fault for leaving it there.

00:20:00.370 --> 00:20:03.060
I won't give you the Embryo!

00:20:03.560 --> 00:20:05.020
Embryo?

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:11.810
Holy Crown!

00:20:22.170 --> 00:20:23.190
They're gone.

00:20:23.260 --> 00:20:25.040
He's good at stirring up trouble.

00:20:25.080 --> 00:20:26.570
I guess he ran away.

00:20:32.440 --> 00:20:35.130
Are you okay? You're not hurt, are you?

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:38.560
I'm fine.

00:20:38.740 --> 00:20:44.800
Hotori-kun, we need you back at the Guardians' Assembly. Everyone's waiting.

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:48.560
You should go home for the rest of today.

00:20:48.780 --> 00:20:50.230
See you.

00:20:50.740 --> 00:20:52.210
U-Um...

00:20:53.470 --> 00:20:57.290
U-Um, t-this...

00:20:58.880 --> 00:21:02.490
Why don't you hold on to it for now, Hinamori Amu-san.

00:21:08.750 --> 00:21:12.340
Why don't you hold on to it for now, Hinamori Amu-san? 

00:21:12.890 --> 00:21:16.930
He said my name! On top of that, he even carried me like a princess!

00:21:16.990 --> 00:21:20.180
The prince's handkerchief smells nice!

00:21:20.210 --> 00:21:22.290
Smells get you going, huh?

00:21:22.350 --> 00:21:24.140
You're still here?

00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:25.610
Of course.

00:21:25.660 --> 00:21:28.080
I'm your Guardian Character, Ran!

00:21:28.610 --> 00:21:31.060
So are those kids who're about to be born.

00:21:35.320 --> 00:21:36.580
B-But...

00:21:37.620 --> 00:21:40.260
The truth is, I like you, Prince!

00:21:40.330 --> 00:21:41.550
I'm sorry.

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:47.340
Right... I was rejected.

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:53.630
Don't worry about it! You'll have plenty more chances!

00:21:54.270 --> 00:21:55.290
Huh?

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:58.620
Amu-chan, wait for me!

00:21:58.660 --> 00:22:00.250
Shut up! Don't follow me!

00:22:00.280 --> 00:22:01.980
Amu-chan!

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:06.770
Jeez, I don't know anything about guardian spirits or Guardian Characters, so leave me alone!

00:22:06.820 --> 00:22:09.470
Amu-chan!

00:22:09.650 --> 00:22:15.520
Still, there are two eggs left. I wonder what type of characters they'll be.

00:22:35.190 --> 00:22:41.290
As long as I exist, even when I'm a pile of dust, 

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:47.690
I'll keep cheering "you can do it, you can do it" out loud! 

00:22:47.690 --> 00:22:48.510
(You can do it!)

00:22:48.510 --> 00:22:54.670
I'll never stop as long as I live,  

00:22:54.670 --> 00:23:01.020
so I'll sing my never-ending song. 

00:23:01.920 --> 00:23:05.530
I'll press forward down my path. 

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:09.050
Even random characters have their merits. 

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:13.890
You might be worthless, but I'll still love you, 

00:23:13.890 --> 00:23:15.360
my darling.

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:19.150
You idiot! My true self... 

00:23:19.150 --> 00:23:22.110
Just say what's on your mind. 

00:23:22.110 --> 00:23:25.540
You're sticking out a little. 

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:28.810
You're coming closer to my dream. 

00:23:28.810 --> 00:23:32.590
You jerk! My true self... 

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:36.840
Please come out, don't hide. 

00:23:36.840 --> 00:23:41.780
Oh yeah! Right now! 

00:23:50.780 --> 00:23:53.110
Man, today was awful.

00:23:53.170 --> 00:23:57.280
I stood out even more than usual, and I was rejected by the prince.

00:23:57.320 --> 00:24:00.270
Don't worry about it! You'll have plenty more chances!

00:24:00.310 --> 00:24:01.500
I wonder about that.

00:24:01.540 --> 00:24:03.390
Wait, all of this was your fault!

00:24:03.420 --> 00:24:06.550
Looks like you two are getting along just fine.

00:24:06.580 --> 00:24:07.970
Huh, who are you?

00:24:08.010 --> 00:24:10.530
Are you the second Guardian Character?

00:24:10.660 --> 00:24:13.460
Next time on Shugo Chara: The Heart's Egg!

00:24:13.500 --> 00:24:15.630
If you have some time, why don't you take a peek?

00:24:15.680 --> 00:24:17.860
Jeez, Amu-chan, you're not straightforward at all.

00:24:17.900 --> 00:24:19.210
Watch it, okay?
